+# Wire Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the wire serialisation format. A decision record (`config/decisions/revoke-wire-format.json`) previously tracked this choice — set to `msgpack` and later updated to `cbor` — but it was removed from the repository in commit `71385f2` ("move decision config out of the tree") along with the rest of the decision config, so there is presently nothing recorded in this repository to state as the project's wire format decision.
